# Keep every text file LF on every machine, Windows included.
#
# Git for Windows checks files out with CRLF by default. The generated catalog files are
# compared byte for byte, the frontmatter and changelog parsers split on newlines, and a
# shell script with CRLF fails with "\r: command not found". So the working tree must be LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
